---
import Logo from '@components/ui/Logo.astro';
---

<footer class="mx-auto mt-auto w-full max-w-[85rem] px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <!-- Grid -->
  <div class="mb-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-5">
    <div class="col-span-full hidden lg:col-span-2 lg:block">
      <a
        class="flex-none text-xl font-semibold text-black focus:opacity-80 focus:outline-hidden dark:text-white"
        href="/"
        aria-label="PT Alur Kriya Teknologi"
      >
        <Logo />
      </a>
      <div
        class="text-text-muted mt-4 space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-800 focus:text-gray-800 focus:outline-hidden dark:text-neutral-400 dark:hover:text-neutral-200 dark:focus:text-neutral-200"
      >
        <p>
          Kami selalu berupaya melakukan pendekatan yang strategis dan eksekusi yang matang, kami
          membantu klien middle–up dan enterprise membangun fondasi teknologi yang kuat, stabil, dan
          siap untuk berkembang di masa mendatang.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Contact Info -->
      <div
        class="text-text-muted mt-4 space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-800 focus:text-gray-800 focus:outline-hidden dark:text-neutral-400 dark:hover:text-neutral-200 dark:focus:text-neutral-200"
